{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0166bA3BoEFVbiByuyMoby9a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Writer 1 — Core Modules\n2\t\n3\t## Scope\n4\tUnit tests for core utility modules: Heuristic.js, Util.js, Node.js, DiagonalMovement.js\n5\t\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t## Priority 1 — src/core/Heuristic.js (HIGH)\n9\t\n10\tZero direct coverage. Pure functions, trivial to test but bugs here corrupt all finders.\n11\t\n12\t- `manhattan(dx, dy)` — e.g. `manhattan(3, 4)` → `7`\n13\t- `euclidean(dx, dy)` — e.g. `euclidean(3, 4)` → `5`\n14\t- `octile(dx, dy)` — both `dx < dy` and `dx >= dy` branches\n15\t- `chebyshev(dx, dy)` — e.g. `chebyshev(3, 4)` → `4`\n16\t- Zero inputs: all four with `(0, 0)` → `0`\n17\t- Symmetry: `heuristic(a, b) === heuristic(b, a)` for octile and chebyshev\n18\t\n19\t## Priority 2 — src/core/Util.js (HIGH)\n20\t\n21\t- `smoothenPath` — entirely untested; also contains bug: `lastValidCoord` used without declaration (implicit global) at Util.js:167. Write tests that expose this.\n22\t- `pathLength` — entirely untested; zero coverage\n23\t- `biBacktrace` — no direct test; only exercised indirectly by bi-directional finders\n24\t- `backtrace` — no direct test; only exercised indirectly\n25\t- `interpolate` — horizontal line (`x0 != x1, y0 == y1`)\n26\t- `interpolate` — diagonal line\n27\t- `interpolate` — same start/end point (`x0==x1, y0==y1`) → single-element result\n28\t- `compressPath` with single-element path (length = 1)\n29\t- `compressPath` with two-element path (length = 2)\n30\t\n31\t## Priority 3 — src/core/Node.js (LOW)\n32\t\n33\t- Direct construction: `new Node(x, y)` — verify default `walkable=true`\n34\t- Explicit `walkable=false` constructor arg\n35\t\n36\t## Priority 4 — src/core/DiagonalMovement.js (MEDIUM)\n37\t\n38\t- Verify enum values are stable: `Always=1`, `Never=2`, `IfAtMostOneObstacle=3`, `OnlyWhenNoObstacles=4`\n39\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df25aa95-fe71-441f-a11b-4c3b42b6f206","uuid":"c0c91aed-2219-48d9-b8b0-de49191f4f5d","timestamp":"2026-04-16T14:01:25.186Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-01-test-blitz/workers/test-writer-1/input/assignments.md","content":"# Test Writer 1 — Core Modules\n\n## Scope\nUnit tests for core utility modules: Heuristic.js, Util.js, Node.js, DiagonalMovement.js\n\n---\n\n## Priority 1 — src/core/Heuristic.js (HIGH)\n\nZero direct coverage. Pure functions, trivial to test but bugs here corrupt all finders.\n\n- `manhattan(dx, dy)` — e.g. `manhattan(3, 4)` → `7`\n- `euclidean(dx, dy)` — e.g. `euclidean(3, 4)` → `5`\n- `octile(dx, dy)` — both `dx < dy` and `dx >= dy` branches\n- `chebyshev(dx, dy)` — e.g. `chebyshev(3, 4)` → `4`\n- Zero inputs: all four with `(0, 0)` → `0`\n- Symmetry: `heuristic(a, b) === heuristic(b, a)` for octile and chebyshev\n\n## Priority 2 — src/core/Util.js (HIGH)\n\n- `smoothenPath` — entirely untested; also contains bug: `lastValidCoord` used without declaration (implicit global) at Util.js:167. Write tests that expose this.\n- `pathLength` — entirely untested; zero coverage\n- `biBacktrace` — no direct test; only exercised indirectly by bi-directional finders\n- `backtrace` — no direct test; only exercised indirectly\n- `interpolate` — horizontal line (`x0 != x1, y0 == y1`)\n- `interpolate` — diagonal line\n- `interpolate` — same start/end point (`x0==x1, y0==y1`) → single-element result\n- `compressPath` with single-element path (length = 1)\n- `compressPath` with two-element path (length = 2)\n\n## Priority 3 — src/core/Node.js (LOW)\n\n- Direct construction: `new Node(x, y)` — verify default `walkable=true`\n- Explicit `walkable=false` constructor arg\n\n## Priority 4 — src/core/DiagonalMovement.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Verify enum values are stable: `Always=1`, `Never=2`, `IfAtMostOneObstacle=3`, `OnlyWhenNoObstacles=4`\n","numLines":39,"startLine":1,"totalLines":39}}}
